[{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0396","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53410","title":"Linux 内核 USB ULPI 驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 USB ULPI 子系统中存在内存泄漏漏洞。在调用 debugfs_lookup() 函数获取 debugfs 目录项后，未正确调用 dput() 释放引用计数，导致内核内存随时间逐渐泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复触发相关代码路径造成系统内存资源耗尽，最终导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53410"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:15Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本（如 v6.6-rc1 及以上），该漏洞已在 commit 9d0e857 中修复。无法立即升级时，可通过内核模块黑名单禁用 ulpi 模块（/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf 中添加 blacklist ulpi）作为临时缓解。嵌入式系统需同步更新 BSP 内核源码并重新编译。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b8aa879e28df11e45855b04788050c61fb6b02a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8f4d25eba599c4bd4b5ea8ae8752cda480a9d563","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dcbe69f4f743a938344b32e60531ea55355e0c08","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53410.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53410.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53410.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53410.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53410","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2023/CVE-2023-53410.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53410.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2023-53410-usb-ulpi-fix-memory-leak-with-using-1765849008000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-xcxp-6m6x-8jpj/GHSA-xcxp-6m6x-8jpj.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53410"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0396.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0395","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0395.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53401","title":"Linux Kernel 内存管理子系统空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核内存管理子系统（mm/memcontrol.c）中的 obj_stock_flush_required() 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。由于 stock->cached_objcg 字段在检查和解引用之间存在竞态条件（data race），本地攻击者可通过特定套接字选项设置（setsockopt）等系统调用触发该竞态，导致内核崩溃（Oops），造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.3-rc2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。修复方式是对 stock->cached_objcg 的所有访问使用 READ_ONCE()/WRITE_ONCE() 宏以消除竞态。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53401"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:13Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.3 及以上版本（含补丁 commit 使用 READ_ONCE()/WRITE_ONCE() 保护 stock->cached_objcg 访问），或应用对应长期支持分支（6.1.y、5.15.y、5.10.y）中反向移植的稳定补丁。发行版用户可通过包管理器安装最新内核更新（如 `apt upgrade linux-image` / `yum update kernel`）并重启系统生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/33391c7e1a2ad612bf3922cc168cb09a46bbe236","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/33d9490b27e5d8da4444aefd714a4f50189db978","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3b8abb3239530c423c0b97e42af7f7e856e1ee96","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53401.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53401.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53401","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53401.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53401.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53401.md","https://github.com/Wxm-233/cross-scope_bugs/blob/6837cabb3f89377ba5e2467d37333b80c69bf5d2/results_reverse/CVE-2023-53401_result.txt","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53401","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53401.json","https://github.com/ellis-wilson-ms/co-lustre/blob/9b5f6a3950a962354660e4b5c3fc6e3ed91ce952/processed/jira/txt/LU/LU-19666.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0395.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0394","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53387","title":"Linux 内核 UFS 核心模块设备管理命令超时处理不当导致释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UFS（通用闪存存储）驱动核心模块中存在设备管理命令超时处理缺陷，当链路恢复过程中发送的 NOP OUT 命令超时且 doorbell 清除失败时，ufshcd_wait_for_dev_cmd() 函数未将栈上分配的 complete 结构体置空便直接返回；若设备随后完成该命令，将触发 use-after-free 导致内核崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，本地攻击者可利用此漏洞发起拒绝服务攻击，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53387"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:10Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.16（6.1.x 分支）、6.2.3（6.2.x 分支）或 6.3 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 commit cf4549343270、3ffd2cd644e0、36822124f9de 中修复。如无法立即更新内核，可临时禁用 UFS 设备（如系统不使用 UFS 存储）或限制本地用户对 UFS 驱动的访问权限，但推荐尽快部署内核补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36822124f9de200cedc2f42516301b50d386a6cd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ffd2cd644e0f1eea01339831bac4b1054e8817c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cf45493432704786a0f8294c7723ad4eeb5fff24","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53387.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53387.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53387.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53387","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53387.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53387.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2023-53387-scsi-ufs-core-fix-device-management-1765849031000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-w6pv-gx3q-3r57/GHSA-w6pv-gx3q-3r57.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2023-53387","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53387.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0393","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53383","title":"Linux kernel GICv3 NVIDIA T241 平台中断控制器状态损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 GICv3 驱动在处理 NVIDIA T241 平台多芯片场景时存在硬件勘误（T241-FABRIC-4），当来自不同 GIC 的多传输 AXI4 Stream 数据包在目标芯片侧发生交织时，会破坏中断控制器内部状态，导致内核崩溃及不可预期行为。该漏洞影响配置超过 2 个 T241 芯片的服务器平台，需满足多插槽间的多传输数据包交互条件。官方通过将寄存器读取定向至 SPI 所属芯片并禁用 GICv4.x 特性实现规避，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53383"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:10Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit af5b3c36e5e0 (irqchip/gicv3: Workaround for NVIDIA erratum T241-FABRIC-4) 的版本，如 6.1.72+、6.6.11+。多插槽 T241 平台须禁用 GICv4 功能，在 cmdline 添加 gicv3_disable_gicv4=1 内核参数；单/双插槽配置不受影响，无需特殊处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/35727af2b15d98a2dd2811d631d3a3886111312e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/867a4f6cf1a8f511c06e131477988b3b3e7a0633","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86ba4f7b9f949e4c4bcb425f2a1ce490fea30df0","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53383.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53383.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53383","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53383.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53383.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53383.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-pg59-r5p5-6cfh/GHSA-pg59-r5p5-6cfh.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53383","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53383.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-72269.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0392","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53376","title":"Linux 内核 SCSI mpi3mr 驱动程序越界内存访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mpi3mr 驱动程序中存在越界内存访问漏洞，该驱动在分配管理位图时以字节为单位计算大小，而内核位图辅助函数需以 unsigned long 为单位，此差异导致在 find_first_zero_bit() 等操作中发生 slab 越界读取。本地攻击者可通过对 eHBA-9600 控制器执行固件下载操作触发该漏洞，造成系统崩溃或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核使用 mpi3mr 驱动的版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53376"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:08Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.18+、6.2.5+ 或 6.3+ 版本，各发行版对应安装对应安全更新包（如 Debian bookworm 升至 6.1.176-1、Ubuntu 安装对应 HWE 内核更新）。如无法立即升级，可执行 `modprobe -r mpi3mr` 卸载 mpi3mr 驱动模块以临时规避风险（注意：该操作将禁用 Broadcom/SAS HBA 适配器功能，需在业务低谷期操作）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/339e61565f81a6534afdc18fd854b2e2628bf5db","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6a675a6d57d31da43d8da576465c1cd5d5b0bd3d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ac713d2e9845e9234bb12ae5903040685d5aff9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53376.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53376.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53376.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53376","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53376.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53376.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2023-53376-scsi-mpi3mr-use-number-of-bits-to-m-1765809374000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-6f3q-hg2c-hwrx/GHSA-6f3q-hg2c-hwrx.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2023-53376","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53376.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0391","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53371","title":"Linux mlx5e 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mlx5e 驱动中的 fs_tt_redirect_any_create 函数在错误路径下未释放 fs->any 指针所指向的内存，导致发生内存泄漏。本地攻击者可利用特定错误触发条件重复调用该函数，逐步耗尽系统内存，最终导致拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响使用 Mellanox ConnectX 网卡的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53371"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:07Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含该补丁的稳定版本（如 6.1.64+、6.5.13+、6.6.3+），对应 commit 为内核主线中的修复提交。若无法立即升级，可通过 `modprobe.blacklist=mlx5_core` 内核参数临时禁用 mlx5_core 模块作为缓解措施，但会导致 Mellanox 网卡不可用。建议在测试环境验证后批量更新生产环境内核。具体修复版本请查阅对应发行版内核包更新日志（如 `apt changelog linux-image-*`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3250affdc658557a41df9c5fb567723e421f8bf2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/75df2fe6d160e16be880aacacd521b135d7177c9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8a75a6f169c3df3a94802314aa61282772ac75b8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53371.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53371.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53371.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53371","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53371.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53371.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/16/seguranca/cve-2023-53371-netmlx5e-fix-memory-leak-in-mlx5e-f-1765935536000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-5337-pr68-xwqf/GHSA-5337-pr68-xwqf.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53371","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53371.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0391.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0390","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0390.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53370","title":"Linux kernel AMD GPU MES 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMD GPU 驱动（drm/amdgpu）中的 MES（微引擎调度器）自检功能存在内存泄漏漏洞。由于 MES 队列关联的 fence 对象在 amdgpu_ring_fini 过程中未被正确释放，本地攻击者可通过反复触发 MES 自检操作消耗系统内存资源，导致内核内存耗尽引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中使用 AMDGPU 驱动的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53370"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:07Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：6.1.47 及以上（6.1.x LTS 分支）、6.4.12 及以上（6.4.x 分支）或 6.5 及以上（主线分支）。可通过发行版包管理器更新内核包（如 Ubuntu 使用 `apt install linux-image-generic`，CentOS/RHEL 使用 `yum update kernel`）。若无法立即升级内核，可禁用 AMD GPU 的 MES 自测功能作为临时缓解，或在启动参数中添加 `amdgpu.ppfeaturemask=0` 禁用相关电源管理特性以规避触发路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/31d7c3a4fc3d312a0646990767647925d5bde540","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d8c96efcec95736622381b2afc0fe9e317f88aa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ce3288d8d654b252ba832626e7de481c195ef20a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53370.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53370.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53370.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2023-53370","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53370.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53370.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2023-53370-drmamdgpu-fix-memory-leak-in-mes-se-1765849057000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-rmfh-6vx9-x965/GHSA-rmfh-6vx9-x965.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53370","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53370.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0390.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0399","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53429","title":"Linux Kernel btrfs 文件系统 __extent_writepage 错误处理逻辑缺陷漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统驱动中的 __extent_writepage 函数存在错误处理逻辑缺陷。该函数在发生 I/O 错误时设置 PageError 标记位，同时又检查该标记位来决定是否调用错误处理逻辑，导致错误处理职责不清晰。在通用写回机制中，I/O 提交后错误处理责任应委托给结束 I/O 处理程序，但如果结束 I/O 处理程序设置 PageError 位而提交者检查该位，该位可能在高速 I/O 场景下泄漏到提交上下文，引发内存状态不一致。本地攻击者可通过触发特定的 btrfs 文件系统 I/O 操作利用此漏洞，可能导致系统崩溃。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53429"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-09-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.4.7 或更高版本，或 cherry-pick 内核提交 3e92499e3b004baffb479d61e191b41b604ece9a 和 d40be032ecd8ee1ca033bee43c7755d21fb4d72a 应用补丁，修复 btrfs __extent_writepage 中 PageError 位检查导致的错误处理竞争条件问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e92499e3b004baffb479d61e191b41b604ece9a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d40be032ecd8ee1ca033bee43c7755d21fb4d72a","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-53429"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0399.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0389","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53367","title":"Linux kernel habanalabs 驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 habanalabs 加速器驱动中存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401），当用户映射（user_mapping）被捕获后立即打开新上下文且执行硬重置时，驱动程序在清除用户映射信息过程中未能正确释放已分配的内存，导致内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过多次触发该操作序列耗尽系统内存资源，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中 accel/habanalabs 模块，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53367"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:07Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.4.12 或更高版本（6.5+），该漏洞已在 6.4.12 稳定版中修复。如无法立即升级，可 cherry-pick 提交 314a7ffd7c19 或 973e0890e526 至受影响内核，该补丁修复了 habanalabs 驱动中 user_mappings 上下文切换时未释放内存导致泄漏的问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/314a7ffd7c196b27eedd50cb7553029e17789b55","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/973e0890e5264cb075ef668661cad06b67777121","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53367.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53367.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53367.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53367.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2023-53367","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53367.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-53367.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2023-53367-accelhabanalabs-fix-mem-leak-in-cap-1765849024000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-mhx5-8p5w-32cq/GHSA-mhx5-8p5w-32cq.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53367"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0389.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0388","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0388.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53366","title":"Linux 内核块设备轮询空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核块设备子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞，当多个任务共享轮询队列执行轮询 I/O 操作时，一个任务完成 I/O 并释放 bio 后，该 bio 可能被另一任务重新分配，导致 bio->bi_bdev 为空指针，触发内核崩溃（拒绝服务）。本地攻击者可通过提交精心构造的 io_uring 轮询请求利用该漏洞导致系统宕机，影响 Linux 5.12+ 内核版本。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53366"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:06Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.16 或 6.2.3 及以上版本，包含提交 310726c33ad7 的补丁。如无法立即升级内核，可在使用 io_uring 轮询 IO 的应用侧避免多任务共享轮询队列作为临时规避措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0510d5e654d05053ed0e6309a9b42043ac9903ab","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1af0bdca03f367874da45d6cbe05fa05b90b1439","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/310726c33ad76cebdee312dbfafc12c1b44bf977","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53366.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53366.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53366.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53366","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53366.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53366.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-53366.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-rggc-f5vc-pggf/GHSA-rggc-f5vc-pggf.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53366","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53366.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0388.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0387","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0387.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53355","title":"Linux kernel staging pi433 debugfs 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 staging 子系统中 pi433 驱动程序存在内存泄漏漏洞。当调用 debugfs_lookup() 函数查找调试文件系统条目时，未正确调用 dput() 释放引用计数，导致内核内存随时间逐渐泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复触发 debugfs 文件系统操作耗尽系统内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。内核社区已通过改用 debugfs_lookup_and_remove() 函数修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53355"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:59Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6 及以上版本（该漏洞已在 v6.6-rc1 修复），或合入对应补丁 commit `8b9c1b2`（将 `debugfs_lookup()` 替换为 `debugfs_lookup_and_remove()`）。如无法升级内核，可在内核参数中禁用 staging 驱动 pi433（`blacklist pi433`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/04f3cda40e9f6653ae15ed3fcf26ef2860f4df66","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f36e789e540df6a9fbf471b3a2ba62a8b361586","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bb16f3102607b69e1a0233f4b73c6e337f86ef8d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53355.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53355.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53355.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53355","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53355.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53355.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-gr54-f9vx-r2h8/GHSA-gr54-f9vx-r2h8.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53355","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53355.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71909.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0387.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0386","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0386.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53353","title":"Linux Kernel accel/habanalabs 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 accel/habanalabs 驱动中存在内存释放不当漏洞（CWE-401），当用户关闭文件描述符时，内存管理器 IDR 被过早销毁，而此时用户上下文可能仍被持有、内存缓冲区可能仍在被使用。后续尝试释放这些缓冲区时因无法在 IDR 中找到句柄而失败，导致内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复打开和关闭 habanalabs 设备文件描述符触发此漏洞，造成系统资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中 habanalabs 驱动的相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53353"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:58Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.3.4 及以上版本，或向后移植补丁提交 2e8e9a895c45（主线）及 840de329ca99（稳定分支），即拆分 mem_mgr IDR 销毁到 hpriv_release() 中释放。由于该漏洞为本地内存泄漏（CVSS 5.5），无法通过配置缓解，唯一修复途径是更新内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2e8e9a895c4589f124a37fc84d123b5114406e94","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/840de329ca99cafd0cdde9c6ac160b1330942aba","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53353.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53353.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53353.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53353","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53353.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53353.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-6pw4-v52h-38vj/GHSA-6pw4-v52h-38vj.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2023-53353","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53353.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71906.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0386.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0385","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0385.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53348","title":"Linux btrfs 文件系统重定位清理死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统存在死锁漏洞。在对块组进行重定位（relocation）操作时，系统先暂停 scrub，执行事务提交，再恢复 scrub。若事务提交进入临界区（TRANS_STATE_COMMIT_START）后失败且 scrub 处于暂停状态，将导致进程永久阻塞（死锁）。本地攻击者可通过 btrfs balance 或 relocate ioctl 在事务失败条件下触发该漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，中危等级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53348"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:57Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.23/6.2.10/6.3 及以上版本；无法立即升级时，避免在 Btrfs 文件系统上同时执行 scrub 与 relocate 操作，先完成 scrub 再执行 balance/relocate。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10a5831b193390b77705fc174a309476c23ba64a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d82a40aa7d6fcae0250ec68b8566cdee7bfd44c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6134a4bb6b1c411a244edee041ac89266c78d45c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53348.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53348.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53348","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53348.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53348.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53348.md","https://github.com/Wxm-233/cross-scope_bugs/blob/6837cabb3f89377ba5e2467d37333b80c69bf5d2/results_reverse/CVE-2023-53348_result.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-vmvh-gj86-w48f/GHSA-vmvh-gj86-w48f.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53348","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53348.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0385.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0384","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0384.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53347","title":"Linux Kernel mlx5 驱动 E-Switch 配对处理不当导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux 内核 mlx5 网卡驱动在处理 E-switch（嵌入式交换机）配对时存在释放后使用漏洞。当用户将设备从 switchdev 模式切换至 legacy 模式，或卸载/重载设备时，上行链路端口的卸载与 E-switch 解配对的执行顺序存在竞态条件，导致已释放的 peer mlx5e_priv 结构体被继续访问，触发空指针解引用，造成内核崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 Mellanox ConnectX 系列网卡且启用 VF_LAG 的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。本地攻击者需具有普通权限并通过卸载绑定 VF_LAG 的网卡设备来触发此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53347"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:57Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.31、6.3.5 或 6.4 及以上版本。如无法升级内核，可在卸载 mlx5 模块前先将网卡从 switchdev 模式切换为 legacy 模式（`devlink dev eswitch set pci/$BDF mode legacy`），避免触发 E-switch 配对解绑时的野指针访问导致内核崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10cbfecc0f99f579fb170feee866c9efaab7ee47","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2be5bd42a5bba1a05daedc86cf0e248210009669","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b17294e7aa8c39dbb9c3e28e2d1983c88b94b387","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53347.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53347.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53347","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53347.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53347.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53347.md","https://github.com/Wxm-233/cross-scope_bugs/blob/6837cabb3f89377ba5e2467d37333b80c69bf5d2/results_reverse/CVE-2023-53347_result.txt","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53347","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53347.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0384.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0383","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0383.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53332","title":"Linux Kernel genirq/ipi 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核通用中断子系统（genirq/ipi）中存在空指针解引用漏洞，当 `ipi_send_mask()` 或 `ipi_send_single()` 函数被传入无效中断号时，所有局部变量均为 NULL，而 `ipi_send_verify()` 函数在调用 `irq_data_get_affinity_mask()` 前未对参数进行空指针检查，导致空指针被解引用进而引发内核崩溃（oops）。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞触发拒绝服务（DoS）条件，影响使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的所有系统。该漏洞由 Linux 验证中心通过 SVACE 静态分析工具发现，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53332"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-16T17:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.2.5 及以上版本（或长期支持分支 6.1.18 及以上版本）。该漏洞已在提交 feabecaff590、926aef60ea64、7448c73d640 中修复，可通过 `git cherry-pick` 将补丁应用到自定义内核，或在发行版中通过包管理器安装更新版本的内核（如 `apt upgrade linux-image`、`yum update kernel`）。无法立即升级时，可限制本地用户对内核 IPI 功能的调用权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7448c73d64075051f50caed2c62f46553b69ab8a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/926aef60ea64cd9becf2829f7388f48dbe8bcb11","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/feabecaff5902f896531dde90646ca5dfa9d4f7d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53332.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53332.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53332.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53332","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53332.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53332.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisorie